    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race, Crash, Explode, Outrun Aliens. Upgrade your car. Get a new one. Run over people. Escape sharks. Fly off jumps. Just have fun. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing</strong>: Race on streets with traffic and people to hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Race</strong>: Hit people and make check points to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Chase</strong>: Don't die or get abducted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Drive</strong>: Just drive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World (64km\u00b2)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Vehicles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructive Driving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Cars</strong>: Customize with performance and visual upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surface-Based Traction</strong>: Surface and tire affect grip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Weather System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Radio</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steering Wheel Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Graphics Options</strong>: Use cell shaded or outlined graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Ups:</strong> Like unlimited nos on a timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Camera Options</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Active Development:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suggest a mode or idea\u2014your input could help the future of the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race, Crash, Explode, Outrun Aliens. Upgrade your car. Get a new one. Run over people. Escape sharks. Fly off jumps. Just have fun. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing</strong>: Race on streets with traffic and people to hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death Race</strong>: Hit people and make check points to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Chase</strong>: Don't die or get abducted</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Drive</strong>: Just drive</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World (64km\u00b2)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Vehicles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructive Driving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Cars</strong>: Customize with performance and visual upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surface-Based Traction</strong>: Surface and tire affect grip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Weather System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Radio</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steering Wheel Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Graphics Options</strong>: Use cell shaded or outlined graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Ups:</strong> Like unlimited nos on a timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Camera Options</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Active Development:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suggest a mode or idea\u2014your input could help the future of the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hit the road in a chaotic open-world driving game. Compete in deathraces, outrun UFOs, or race for glory. Earn points by completing challenges or mowing down pedestrians, then use them to unlock new cars and upgrades. Fast, violent, and unpredictable. Every drive is pure mayhem.",
